# The engine is checksummed over raw bytes in every generated repo, so a CRLF
# conversion here would silently change what gets vendored outward. Pin LF for
# the canonical source of truth itself, exactly as generated repos do.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.mjs text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
